# ── Portfolio agent (Q&A + meeting booking) ──────────────────
# 1. Get a FREE key: https://console.groq.com/keys  (no credit card)
#    Model used: llama-3.3-70b-versatile — answers questions, and can
#    check real availability / book meetings via tools.
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_key_here

# 2. Meeting-booking email notifications (server-side EmailJS).
#    Reuse the SAME Service ID as the contact form
#    (NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID). In your EmailJS dashboard, create a
#    template (e.g. "meeting_booked") with variables: to_email, from_name,
#    from_email, meeting_time, topic. Then enable "Private key" access in
#    Account → Security and paste it below.
EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
EMAILJS_PRIVATE_KEY=
